  "description": "[Pre-serialization](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list?titleId=644466)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/mohana), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4419002333), [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/mohana/?p_id=tw1547), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6700567), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000050014)\n\nWork boss, senior, meeting application... Every man I meet is in a mess with dating! At this point, she is a elk in the love world, or a elk?!! The harsh love stories that Miss Mohana will go through. It starts with an \"adult cartoon\" for a more sincere, honest and staunch story!",
